<p>Dear <%= @invitation.candidate_name %>,</p>
<p>You are invited to the online assessment for the <b><%= @invitation.vacancy %></b> role.</p>
<p><a href="<%= exam_url(@invitation.token) %>" style="display:inline-block;padding:10px 18px;background:#059669;color:#fff;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:bold">Start your online test</a></p>
<p>Link: <a href="<%= exam_url(@invitation.token) %>"><%= exam_url(@invitation.token) %></a><br>
Your HR will share the OTP with you when you open the link.</p>
<% if @invitation.link_expires_at %><p>The link is valid until <b><%= @invitation.link_expires_at.strftime("%d %b %Y, %-I:%M %p") %></b>.</p><% end %>
<p><b>Please read the attached candidate guide</b> before you start — it explains what you need, the pen &amp; paper rules and what gives a warning during the test.</p>
<% if @invitation.meeting_link.present? %><p>Interview meeting link: <a href="<%= @invitation.meeting_link %>"><%= @invitation.meeting_link %></a></p><% end %>
<p>All the best!<br>HR team</p>
